values ('a1b2c3d4-5e6f-4a31-8b01-1c2d3e4f5a21', 'business-law', 'Business Law', 'This course introduces the legal environment of business through the lens of human resources. Students learn the foundations of courts, contracts, agency, torts, business organizations, employment law, labor law, regulation, intellectual property, privacy, ethics, and legal case analysis. The emphasis is practical: spotting legal issues early, documenting decisions responsibly, knowing when to involve counsel, and communicating risk in a professional HR voice.');

