ions, restrictive covenants, onboarding, and exits. This topic teaches how intellectual property law intersects with talent management.", "children": [{"id": "ebc4109b-eb66-4c9b-ab79-523c297a2897", "type": "subtopic", "title": "IP fundamentals", "children": [{"id": "0492c418-5b63-4866-9e88-85a5c5a37862", "type": "concept", "title": "Copyright"}, {"id": "430d49aa-d39d-4b2c-9758-1daf63d7e23d", "type": "concept", "title": "Trademark"}, {"id": "3ccd7af3-322e-47aa-99fb-7f1c5aabd151", "type": "concept", "title": "Patent"}, {"id": "fc5bc14b-7b31-4f54-a1d1-0ead6b7cfcc3", "type": "concept", "title": "Trade secrets"}, {"id": "bb1d9d70-1236-44be-8edb-ce97a4753955", "type": "concept", "title": "Licensing"}], "description": "Students learn the major forms of legal protection for business knowledge and creative work."}, {"id": "17054175-6b86-4192-882a-b19baae92803", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Employee-created work and ownership", "children": [{"id": "83aa1883-a7c8-4117-bed8-2736e89c4dea", "type": "concept", "title": "Work made for hire"}, {"id": "e36d65a5-a789-429a-9de4-5cef314bf8ee", "type": "concept", "title": "Invention assignment"}, {"id": "c3ad7c6a-241b-4a58-8bf8-488d641b7893", "type": "concept", "title": "Consultant agreements"}, {"id": "915c5fa0-9c0c-478a-8804-67cfdcc2e072", "type": "concept", "title": "Moral rights basics"}, {"id": "4389e359-6b4e-433b-8727-78139b0b9a92", "type": "concept", "title": "Open-source issues"}], "description": "This subtopic explains who owns work created in employment or contractor relationships."}, {"id": "37d91b81-3aae-4e06-b486-683a498656fa", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Restrictive covenants and mobility", "children": [{"id": "5d3af5b3-a611-4c82-b115-fb21f5fc1b3d", "type": "concept", "title": "Noncompetes"}, {"id": "8a1d0576-c102-4d97-8a37-389fdc8a1aa2", "type": "concept", "title": "Nonsolicitation"}, {"id": "2dad2325-efa2-4157-a249-cd99b5f95357", "type": "concept", "title": "Nondisclosure agreements"}, {"id": "86afef90-7bc3-4c32-94b8-a