pt", "title": "Justice and fairness"}, {"id": "c135e662-4578-4717-b8a8-d3bb6cc82060", "type": "concept", "title": "Professional integrity"}], "description": "Students learn structured ways to reason through ambiguous business and workplace problems."}, {"id": "61b35fde-892f-488e-8eb6-65b1dad38272", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Corporate social responsibility and ESG", "children": [{"id": "dfac9d04-f2c4-43cb-8a7d-9cfc50c563ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Human rights"}, {"id": "4e955e03-f7df-47b8-87cc-82451eb637fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Supply chains"}, {"id": "52e58a70-18dd-4004-a4ae-fc805db27570", "type": "concept", "title": "Pay equity"}, {"id": "009e89f4-3766-40bf-98b6-c65defcdc325", "type": "concept", "title": "Board oversight"}, {"id": "7d8f16cb-18e5-4ecb-8a59-437b715f736c", "type": "concept", "title": "ESG disclosure"}, {"id": "59d16999-a204-4c52-a1b7-f727a490bdcc", "type": "concept", "title": "Greenwashing risk"}], "description": "This subtopic links legal compliance to broader commitments around workers, communities, sustainability, and governance."}, {"id": "431b25fc-85ae-4a17-8752-f41d59d7a1d2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "HR professional responsibility", "children": [{"id": "65a63b6a-3d33-46ca-8646-698f4ea05eab", "type": "concept", "title": "Confidentiality"}, {"id": "12272363-35d8-4623-afdc-5b26eee71b00", "type": "concept", "title": "Conflicts of interest"}, {"id": "97665199-f774-449b-8c2c-39d98954c3ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Candor with counsel"}, {"id": "fdce2294-c72f-44a5-be5d-0923357f84bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Employee advocacy"}, {"id": "bca7afd6-205d-4922-abe2-eb35f05c8bf7", "type": "concept", "title": "Retaliation prevention"}, {"id": "e0427fe9-8d43-43bc-bf97-ca27a8cc84f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Ethical escalation"}], "description": "Students learn how HR maintains trust while serving employees, managers, and the organization."}]}, {"id": "f7502f69-95dd-4bc2-b490-7964de96832c", "type": "topic", "title": "Legal Case Analysis and HR Issue Spotting Capstone", "description": "The capstone trains students to read cases, brief legal issues, analyze messy facts, and communicate practical recommendations. The emphasis is not memorizing rules, but becoming the HR professional who can see the issue early and frame it responsibly.", "children": [{"id": "a4c76a70-a943-4803-812b-1e92487ff4c4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Case briefing", "children": [{"id": "4b92d163-09e6-4280-bd02-4cefa87c4e87", "type": "concept", "title": "Facts"}, {"id": "90b6171a-b33a-4594-8cc4-2e0bc4490a48", "type": "concept", "title": "Procedural posture"}, {"id": "3b598be7-599f-4a46-89b7-0ce37f9bedfb", "type": "concept", "title": "Issue"}, {"id": "d0be2804-1f65-447b-aa01-0c7a7bc73ee6", "type": "concept", "title": "Holding"}, {"id": "806ce303-90a3-44f0-b19f-29eb397e201a", "type": "concept", "title": "Reasoning"}, {"id": "b59db048-d0d2-4d3a-bebf-ee6efe3ddd38", "type": "concept", "title": "Dissent"}], "description": "Students practice extracting rules and reasoning from judicial opinions and agency decisions."}, {"id": "d6d587f8-b61d-4153-89fb-2c100f2f5992", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Scenario-based issue spotting", "children": [{"id": "ae5be9bc-299e-4c41-8362-24e505c69001", "type": "concept", "title": "Hiring scenarios"}, {"id": "4c674bc0-e306-4df0-99c2-6f945c5bcccb", "type": "concept", "title": "Termination scenarios"}, {"id": "3dd80c12-3ebf-4620-8999-85e73c1913c3", "type": "concept", "title": "Harassment investigations"}, {"id": "51de2d53-f75f-4d98-b117-5b1c89709962", "type": "concept", "title": "Leave and accommodation"}, {"id": "a782a819-61e2-4c67-a3cb-8d15d2a82363", "type": "concept", "title": "Data incidents"}, {"id": "8aea648c-53c2-4cb1-93e7-74ebc4be5ef5", "type": "concept", "title": "Union activity"}], "description": "This subtopic develops the habit of identifying legal, ethical, operational, and reputational risks in one fact pattern."}, {"id": "504011bf-942c-433c-8e3c-ed757ec4d805", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Professional legal communication", "children": [{"id": "f99a808c-cb96-4b44-aa77-e9dc65970e1c", "type": "concept", "title": "Executive summary"}, {"id": "81d86718-b8cc-4eff-a6dc-87fc52da7a08", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk rating"}, {"id": "93e5843c-7978-4bda-ab82-71cc1e4ca2eb", "type": "concept", "title": "Open facts"}, {"id": "c95f5206-71f5-47a6-b5ae-a29dbd9c8ce1", "type": "concept", "title": "Options and tradeoffs"}, {"id": "84b3a68b-945b-4ec3-a2a0-4f9adced4f88", "type": "concept", "title": "Recommended next steps"}, {"id": "1a8993f1-35fb-41a9-8b12-ca1dae9207dc", "type": "concept", "title": "Questions for counsel"}], "description": "Students learn to write concise, non-lawyer legal risk analyses for managers and counsel."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$blawjson$::jsonb,
